{%- comment -%}
  Shared disclaimer. Usage: {% include disclaimer.liquid what="notes" %}   (what: notes | infographics | playgrounds)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign dc_what = include.what | default: 'notes' -%}
<aside class="sb-disclaimer" role="note">
  <span class="sb-disclaimer-label">Please note</span>
  <p>
    {% if dc_what == 'infographics' -%}
      These infographics
    {%- elsif dc_what == 'playgrounds' -%}
      These playgrounds
    {%- else -%}
      These notes and summaries
    {%- endif %}
    are based on my own understanding and learning process. They are meant as study aids, are not peer reviewed, and may contain mistakes or
    simplifications. If you notice an error or a discrepancy, please <a href="mailto:{{ site.data.legal.email }}">contact me</a> and I will correct
    it.
  </p>
</aside>
